    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/01_quote.png"
    "-A researcher's diary"

    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/02_establishing_shot.png"
    ""
    scene image "12_mist_on_the_waster/03_reunion.png"
    carrier "And...here we go!"
    levania "Are you well?"
    fio "Yes, Mr. Monster. I'm sorry for worrying you."
    carrier "Now let us make our pilgrimage to each Dark Scarecrow with gusto!"
    fio "Ooo, pretty! There's water everywhere."
    fio "Can we go play in it?"
    carrier "I fear we've no time to spare for splashing about, young miss."
